---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import hero from '../../assets/photos/dove-camp-2026.webp';
---


<Page title="Dove Camp 2026 | 44 Bar Ranch" description="Opening weekend at 44 Bar Ranch means dove hunting with friends and tall tales around a West Texas campfire.">
	<section class="hero" slot="hero">
		<h1 class="sr-only">Dove Camp 2026</h1>
		<Picture
			src={hero}
			formats={['avif']}
			alt="Dove Camp 2026 ranch poster with friends laughing around a West Texas campfire"
			layout="full-width"
			widths={[480, 768, 1024, 1280]}
			sizes="100vw"
			loading="eager"
			fetchpriority="high"
			pictureAttributes={{ class: 'hero-picture' }}
		/>
	</section>


	<p class="tagline">Dove in the daylight. Tall tales after dark.</p>


	<section class="intro">
		<h2>Opening weekend at 44 Bar Ranch</h2>
		<p class="lede">
			Every year when dove season opens, we get friends out to the ranch for a weekend of hunting.
			After sundown we pull our chairs up to the fire, crack open something cold, and start tellin’ yarns.
			By the second telling, even the birds we missed were flying twice as fast.
		</p>
	</section>
</Page>
